# Week 4 starter

When editing `assignments/week4/**`, follow `assignments/week4/CLAUDE.md`.

- Run commands from `assignments/week4/` with `PYTHONPATH=.` (see Makefile).
- Endpoint changes: failing test → implement → `make test` → `make lint`.
- Keep `docs/API.md` aligned with OpenAPI after route changes.
- Prefer slash workflows documented in `.claude/commands/week4-tests.md` and `week4-docs-sync.md`.
